# WCAG 2.2 AA

- Use the **wcag-2-2-aa** skill when implementing or reviewing accessibility.
- Buttons/links need clear names (visible text or `aria-label`); icon-only controls must have `aria-label`.
- Use `aria-expanded` on expand/collapse toggles. Use `type="button"` on non-submit buttons.
- Ensure one `<h1>` per page and logical heading order. Set `lang` on `<html>` (already done in layout).
- Run `npm run lint` and fix any jsx-a11y rules. For full WCAG 2.2 AA, run `npm run dev` then `npm run a11y`.
